        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Colorado_2/_scene_bull.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 73f1046e-7c74-42b6-b4a7-7e4dd34f25af).Image",
        "Description": "This is a strange contract 47, so be prepared. Penelope Graves, undercover interpol agent infilitrating the militia, has identified 4 key individuals in charge of general militia operations. Eliminating them via accidents will distract the militia long enough for the authorities to bust the operation. However, Ms Graves is facing certain death after getting compromised. She wants to go out on her own terms, so kill her in a way that can be blamed on the militia&apos;s using their violent methods.",
